ittedly more  intelligent candidate of the two while  smell a result to go on and try and  solve the Kira case in his own way  however it should be noticed that Nia  was more than willing to work together  with Miller on the case showing a level  of maturity far beyond what you'd expect  of your average thirteen-year-old genius  and at this time we should also point  out that the series protagonists don't  cure himself Light Yagami  had commandeered the role of L and was  continuing to mislead investigators with  the help of the remaining members of the  cure task force and when I say helping  them I mean he was tricking them into  doing what he wanted them to do Nia then  spent four years gathering evidence and  information concerning the case and  finally with the help of  the FBI the CIA and even the President  of the United States he created an  organization known as the special  provision for Kyra or spk for short and  this group was tasked with pursuing Kyra  without the current l's help however  after a couple of conversations would  light Nia quickly started to suspect  that he was in fact Kira and started  looking for evidence to prove his  suspicions as part of the confrontations  between the and light the audience was  able to see Nia's capabilities as a  detective firsthand and it should be  noted that he is outrageously smart and  according to the Encyclopedia death no  13 how to read his mental capacities  could even possibly surpass that of L's  although the writer of Death Note  Tsugumi Oba has explicitly stated that L  is the smartest character introduced in  the series so take that information as  you will furthermore as stated before  Nia is capable of absurdly fast puzzle  solving and a very special brand of  outside of the box thinking he has a  very calm personality and actually  enjoys having people around him because  it is said that Nia's mental abilities  work at their highest potential if he  has people around that he is able to  share ide